        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>糖</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: #eeeeee;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n      color: #565656;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #efefef;\n    }\n\n    .page-title {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 25px;\n      left: 0;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #171717;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n    }\n\n    .sheet {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 78px;\n      left: 32px;\n      width: 486px;\n      height: 623px;\n      background: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 64px;\n      left: 8px;\n      width: 460px;\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #9a8151;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .process-text {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .process-text p {\n      margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      line-height: 1.78;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .bullet {\n      color: #aa925c;\n    }\n\n    .application {\n      margin-top: 35px;\n    }\n\n    .application-list {\n      margin-top: 19px;\n    }\n\n    .application-list p {\n      margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      line-height: 1.78;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .number {\n      color: #ae9b70;\n    }\n  </style>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1 class=\"page-title\">糖</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"sheet\">\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <section>\n          <h2>生产工艺：</h2>\n          <div class=\"process-text\">\n            <p><span class=\"bullet\">●</span>根据香型可分为清香型（甘蔗原浆直接熬制）、蜜香型、复合香型、焦香型（黑糖）、甜香型（分质加压红糖）五种。</p>\n            <p><span class=\"bullet\">●</span>不能以颜色深浅判定红糖优劣。红糖颜色受水分含量、甘蔗的品种品质、熬煮温度/压力/pH 值和氧化程度影响，浅色和深色都是正常的。</p>\n            <p><span class=\"bullet\">●</span>块状红糖并非比粉状红糖好。只有成熟度更高的甘蔗和品质更好的澄清蔗汁才能生产粉状红糖。</p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"application\">\n          <h2>应用：</h2>\n          <div class=\"application-list\">\n            <p><span class=\"number\">①</span>很多中式餐品非红糖不可，如桂花糖藕、肚脐饼。</p>\n            <p><span class=\"number\">②</span>为许多西式餐品带来背景风味，如姜饼、烤肉酱、烩豆。</p>\n            <p><span class=\"number\">③</span>红糖呈弱酸性，烘焙时和小苏打同用产生二氧化碳可增加面团气体含量使其蓬松。</p>\n            <p><span class=\"number\">④</span>还原糖成分有保水功能，用于烧肉、炒蛋可使菜品嫩滑多汁。</p>\n            <p><span class=\"number\">⑤</span>其抗 yang 化功能可减缓食品变质。</p>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
